messages ({(["id":45,"title":"About Limit of Buy Potions","body":"To all,
    The amount you can buy is 正比於 your level....
L1 can buy 5 bandage and L19 near 20, Each shop has its
count, that is even you cant buy at Farwind.. you can buy
at Eastland, too. BTW, vendor is 连锁店。
Note: Each potion has its amount reduce number, max is bandage*2 now.
      and about 30 sec add your pool 1%*max, so near 50 mins to 
      MAX............ and so on.
                                               -Kyoko.
